Hi Adam, bumping this in case it got buried.

Short version: one long video in, captioned clips scheduled across all your accounts, comments sorted, and a weekly report on what worked. Self-hosted, official APIs only.

Tour: https://claude.ai/artifact/6vATPDY7KzqGk1y3LSyRiG
Worth 20 minutes? {BOOKING LINK}

